step Coarse Blasting Powder to 94
  tip Coarse Blasting Powder is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 90, grey 95): about 30 crafts to 94, up to 38 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Coarse Stone. One Coarse Stone a craft (Tin Veins).
  craft 3929 until 94

step Mine Copper Ore, smelt Copper Bar
  tip 40 Copper Bar for Engineering 94-100: 20 Copper Tubes; from your mining on the way: 40 of 40 Copper Ore. Your bags hold it already, smelt 40 Copper Bar at a forge, then craft 14 Copper Tubes (Engineering 94 to 100). The window lists the Mining areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 2840 x40 gather Mining 1
