step Smelt Gold
  tip A Mining trainer also teaches Smelt Gold (25s): smelting at a forge raises Mining too, so smelt what you mine.
  learn 3308

step Artisan Mining
  tip Artisan Mining raises Mining's cap to 300, needs Mining 200 and costs 5g (the arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction).
  train Mining Artisan

step Mine Heavy Stone (Mining 200-213)
  tip 70 Heavy Stone for Engineering 125-144: 70 Heavy Blasting Powder. Mine 70 Heavy Stone (Mining 200 to 213), then craft 52 Heavy Blasting Powder (Engineering 125 to 144). The window lists the Mining areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
