step Engineering recipes at 125
  tip Back to an Engineering trainer: Heavy Blasting Powder (from 125).
  learn 3945

step Heavy Blasting Powder to 144
  tip Heavy Blasting Powder is yellow at 125 (yellow 125, green 135, grey 145): about 52 crafts to 144, up to 70 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Heavy Stone. One Heavy Stone a craft (Iron Deposits). Keep some: Iron Grenades take one each.
  craft 3945 until 144

step Mine Copper Ore and Tin Ore, smelt Bronze Bar
  tip 27 Bronze Bar for Engineering 144-150: 9 Big Bronze Bombs; from your mining on the way: 14 of 14 Copper Ore and 14 of 14 Tin Ore. Your bags hold it already, smelt 27 Bronze Bar at a forge, then craft 7 Big Bronze Bombs (Engineering 144 to 150). The window lists the Mining areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 2841 x63 gather Mining 65
