step Engineering recipes at 175
  tip Back to Springspindle Fizzlegear (Ironforge) (Alliance) or Roxxik (Orgrimmar) (Horde): Solid Blasting Powder (from 175).
  learn 12585 npc 5174 only Alliance
  learn 12585 npc 11017 only Horde

step Solid Blasting Powder to 195
  tip Solid Blasting Powder is yellow at 175 (yellow 175, green 185, grey 195): about 72 crafts to 195, up to 103 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Solid Stone. Two Solid Stone a craft (Mithril Deposits). Make plenty: the triggers, slugs and Gyro-Shot all use it.
  craft 12585 until 195

step Mine Heavy Stone and Iron Ore, smelt Iron Bar
  tip 43 Heavy Stone and 81 Iron Bar for Engineering 195-210: 27 Big Iron Bombs; from your mining on the way: 17 of 43 Heavy Stone and 81 of 81 Iron Ore. Mine 26 Heavy Stone at the areas of Mining 125-155, the richest in it (they give no more points), smelt 81 Iron Bar at a forge, then craft 22 Big Iron Bombs (Engineering 195 to 210). The window lists the Mining areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 2838 x43 gather Mining 125
