step Engineering recipes at 210
  tip Back to Springspindle Fizzlegear (Ironforge) (Alliance) or Roxxik (Orgrimmar) (Horde): Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs (from 210).
  learn 12596 npc 5174 only Alliance
  learn 12596 npc 11017 only Horde

step Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs to 225
  tip Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs is yellow at 210 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 19 crafts to 225, up to 22 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Mithril Bar and 1 Solid Blasting Powder and makes 200. Use the 19 Solid Blasting Powder you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One Mithril Bar and one Solid Blasting Powder a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby. Engineering 225 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 12596 until 225
  skill Engineering 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan (225-300)
section Engineering 225-300

step Artisan Engineering
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Engineering 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Buzzek Bracketswing (Tanaris); Horde Buzzek Bracketswing (Tanaris). This route trains it at Buzzek Bracketswing (Tanaris) for the Alliance and Buzzek Bracketswing (Tanaris) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 225-300: one trainer for every visit. 225-300 takes about 2g 80s of recipes, plus 145 Mithril Bar, 174 Thorium Bar and 26 Runecloth to gather or buy.
  level 35
  train Engineering Artisan npc 8736 only Alliance
  train Engineering Artisan npc 8736 only Horde

step Schematic: Thorium Widget
  tip Schematic: Thorium Widget teaches Thorium Widget (Engineering 260) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: Gearcutter Cogspinner (Ironforge), limited stock; Horde: Sovik (Orgrimmar), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too.
  buy 16042 nearest

step Schematic: Thorium Tube
  tip Schematic: Thorium Tube teaches Thorium Tube (Engineering 275) for 1g 60s. Sold by Alliance: Kor'gar (Riverglades) and Xizzer Fizzbolt (Winterspring), limited stock; Horde: Xizzer Fizzbolt (Winterspring), limited stock.
  buy 16047 nearest

step Get Runecloth
  tip 26 Runecloth for Engineering 225-300: 26 Thorium Widgets. Humanoids of level 45-60 drop it, and what you loot as you level counts. The arrow takes you to the best farm for your level: mobs at or below it first, then the most Runecloth per minute and the nearest; it picks again as you level. The guide window shows the kills and minutes it takes there and a second choice. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x26 nearest gather levels 45-60
  auction 14047 x26

step Mine Mithril Ore and Solid Stone, smelt Mithril Bar
  tip 79 Mithril Bar and 52 Solid Stone for Engineering 225-245: 79 Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs; from your mining on the way: 79 of 79 Mithril Ore. Mine 52 Solid Stone at the areas of Mining 230-245, the richest in it (they give no more points), smelt 79 Mithril Bar at a forge, then craft 62 Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs (Engineering 225 to 245). The window lists the Mining areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 7912 x52 gather Mining 230
