step Thorium Widget to 287
  tip Thorium Widget is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 290, grey 300): about 24 crafts to 287, up to 26 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 3 Thorium Bar and 1 Runecloth. Three Thorium Bars and a Runecloth a craft; the widgets are parts for the later Thorium gadgets. Needs an anvil nearby.
  learn 19791 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 19791 until 287

step Mine Thorium Ore, smelt Thorium Bar
  tip 96 Thorium Bar for Engineering 287-300: 16 Thorium Tubes. Mine 96 Thorium Ore at the areas of Mining 275-300, the richest in it (they give no more points), smelt 96 Thorium Bar at a forge, then craft 14 Thorium Tubes (Engineering 287 to 300). The window lists the Mining areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
