step Thorium Tube to 300
  tip Thorium Tube is orange at 287 (yellow 295, green 305, grey 315): about 14 crafts to 300, up to 16 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 6 Thorium Bar. The schematic binds when picked up; six Thorium Bars a craft. Needs an anvil nearby. Engineering 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
